    "body": "Thanks for the Apple silicon measure (16160 / 15432 / 1571). Fixed on f9a9ba87, test-only: the heavy pin's (moves, planar, arcs) is now exact per measured platform via `cfg` - Windows x86_64 (16197, 15458, 1581), macOS aarch64 (16160, 15432, 1571), your numbers at 608126a5 - and a band covering both on any unmeasured target, with a note to add its exact triple. No warnings, no fallback level and no budget note stay exact everywhere. A single band for all platforms was not taken: on Windows, the release platform, a +-55 band would hide small changes. Bit-stability across platforms is #1010. Re-run here: heavy pin in release passes (16197 / 15458 / 1581); pocket3d_hsm debug suite and clippy -D warnings clean. Left as a draft.",
