    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: f9a9ba871261d99ffb18575d2175059f817065a2 -->\n**Delta review (M5, since 608126a5): ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n\nThe new commits are 8c814901, a merge of main, and f9a9ba87, the requested re-pin. `bore_path_matches` pins the (moves, planar, arcs) triple exactly per measured platform (Windows x86_64 16197/15458/1581, macOS aarch64 16160/15432/1571) and uses a band elsewhere. `fell.is_empty()` is kept, so Z 20 and Z 10 must keep the HSM plan.\n\n**Measured here (macOS, Apple silicon), release, on this head merged with current upstream/main:** `moves 16160 planar 15432 arcs 1571`, no rings fallback, test passes in 109.6 s. That matches the macOS pin exactly.\n\n**Merge note:** #1014 (merge-ready) rewrites the same assertions for the OLD plan. Whichever of the two merges second has to take this PR's form, since this PR's plan is the one that holds after both. The simplest order is #1014 first, then this PR merges main and keeps its own assertions.",
